{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>佐敦有人猝死。今日（18日）下午3時27分，廣東道566號一名男住戶於單位內暈倒，其友人發現後報案求助。</p><p>救援人員接報趕至，發現51歲尼泊爾籍男事主昏迷不醒，隨即由救護車將他送往廣華醫院搶救，其後被證實死亡。警方將案件列「送院時死亡」處理，稍後將驗屍確定其死因。據了解，事主有身體病紀錄。</p><figure><img alt=\"事主被送往廣華醫院搶救後不治。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186579876782542848604831.jpeg/A_i1h7LFxBgwiZU6R8PDO_vVgM31VkYjuDSNj7g0jY8\"/><figcaption>事主被送往廣華醫院搶救後不治。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T08:38:37.028992+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T08:16:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T12:37:45.346543+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T08:37:35.139205+00:00","content_hash":"6159622a8cb2cdace54bb1582c8a2c35328e4bf14cd1d843e3a6d9bd1e881a00","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}